      "role": "user",
      "content": "For each of our 40 kidney cancer patients I need one number per transcription factor that captures that TF's regulatory strength in that patient, so we can relate it to survival. We have expression, a motif prior and a TF-TF PPI. I'm honestly not sure whether 'regulatory strength' here should mean how strongly the TF is wired to its targets or how active the TF is; my PI used both phrasings."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Routing matched these registered workflows to your words, but the capability check did not confirm that any of them gives what you asked for:\n- **LIONESS-PANDA** — produces: One TF-gene network per sample, plus the aggregate network.\n- **GIRAFFE** — produces: A signed TF-to-gene regulatory matrix (positive activating, negative repressing), across all samples. Each TF's activity in each sample, estimated apart from its own mRNA level.\n\nCompare what each produces with what you asked for. Ask again to re-run the check, or say which result you want and from which workflow.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
